abstract: >-
  Repository revision for the PeerJ Computer Science AI Application
  resubmission. Numerical inputs and results are unchanged from peerj-20261002,
  commit e46537227018997c431cbce76775359f3c943a19. Revised documentation and
  author-supplied SQL describe transaction-data access; the original Dune
  transaction CSV is not redistributed. The code reproduces the predictor
  comparison from supplied derived inputs. Cite the exact Git commit used;
